{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nI write from my room in Brussels, having just finished dinner. The food was competent, if lacking the warmth of home, and I paid four francs for the meal, which I consider fair given the service. I spent the morning resting after the diligence, which was a wretched affair; the driver drove as if he were fleeing a ghost, and my back is still complaining.\n\nI met Cousin this afternoon. He is as lively as ever, though his talk of philosophy grew tedious after the first hour. We walked the streets and looked at the shops. I must confess, the tailors here are inferior to those in Berlin, but I found a decent cravat.\n\nI depart for Cologne tomorrow morning. Do ensure my letter regarding the accounts is waiting for me there, as I need to settle the matter with the publisher. I hope the journey will be less turbulent.\n\nYour affectionate,\nG.W.F."}}],"created":1795219260,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":195,"prompt_tokens":1115,"total_tokens":1310,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-bdgIhLAnhN33gx6dPovV6vm8d0dq5gHq","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1115,"prompt_ms":1179.793,"prompt_per_token_ms":1.0581103139013452,"prompt_per_second":945.0810438780363,"predicted_n":195,"predicted_ms":4587.834,"predicted_per_token_ms":23.64862886597938,"predicted_per_second":42.285749658771444}}